  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 26 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nHere's your chance to get into one of the best apartment blocks in Browns Bay. Sub - Penthouse in The Bacchus. Luxury and design meet beachside living. Everything is at your fingertips here, right in the heart of Browns Bay.\r\nVendor is moving to a retirement village and is very keen for a quick sale.\r\nHere's your opportunity to get a fantastic deal\r\nTwo generous bedrooms, each with their own bathroom, plus an office for those who work from home. Very generous living area flowing to a lovely deck.\r\nBuilt in 2000. These apartments have stood the test of time and have wonderful amenities, including a swimming pool and Boules/Petanque Court.\r\nVery private and secure, you will love living here, be like being on holiday all year around.\r\nTwo covered car parks in the basement complete the picture.\r\nVery serious about selling. Make your offer today.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
